            "review_title": "Review at O Tinh House",
            "review_text": "Doug D\n5 contributions\n0\nFantastic Restaurant! Don't miss this spot!\nDec 2024 • Couples\nMy wife and I went to this spot twice while visiting Ho Chi Minh City. We were greeted by the owner, Olia, who is simply wonderful! Her husband is the chef, and they have had the place open for a couple of years. The food was the best we found while in HCMC. We went back twice because we wanted to try more of the items on the menu. We went with all of the suggestions, and loved everything. Really, you can't go wrong with anything on the menu. We were also treated to some of the best draft IPA that we had on our Vietnam trip. We sat by the door to watch the wonderful goings on outside on the street and sidewalk. We recommend visiting early in your visit, because you'll want to come back!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nWe went early in the evening, and didn't have any trouble finding a table.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 10, 2025",
