            "review_title": "Review at O Tinh House",
            "review_text": "Vera H\n16 contributions\n0\nGem of a Restaurant\nFeb 2025 • Couples\nThe restaurant is amazing. Inside has great atmosphere, a casual elegance about it. The food was really good. The beef ribs were so tasty as was the shrimp on lemongrass skewers. I enjoy IPAs and had their Jasmine IPA. It was great. \n\nIt’s a husband and wife who run it and both speak English. With the husband from California and wife from Russia. It was great chatting with them too. \n\nIt is a must try. We’re going back a second night to try other menu items!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 21, 2025",
